<title>USA: Transport Corp of America to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Transport Corp of America to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport Corp of America Inc said Wednesday its board of directors has approved a stock repurchase program for up to 350,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company currently has 6.5 million shares outstanding, the company said.  </p>
<p>The purchases will be made time to time in the open market, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3/8 at 11 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
